 "etapas": [
  {
   "etapa": "explicar",
   "piezas": [
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "The completed past",
     "texto": [
      "To describe a finished action, add **-dı/-di/-du/-dü** or, after a voiceless consonant, **-tı/-ti/-tu/-tü**. Then the person is added: **geldim** (I came), **gittim** (I went), **izledim** (I watched).",
      "**Dün** means yesterday; **geçen hafta** means last week.",
      "Informal question: **Ne yaptın?** = what did you do? The verb **yapmak** (to do) has a common irregular form: **yaptım** (I did)."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    }
   ]
  },
